    "synopsis": {
        "native": "500 ans apr\u00e8s sa disparition, Jerome Bosch, l\u2019un des plus grands peintres flamands, continue \u00e0 intriguer avec une \u0153uvre aussi fascinante qu\u2019\u00e9nigmatique, aux interpr\u00e9tations multiples. A travers Le Jardin des D\u00e9lices, historiens de l\u2019art, philosophes, psychanalystes en cherchent le sens et rendent un hommage vibrant \u00e0 un artiste qui d\u00e9fie le temps.",
        "english": "Five hundred years after his death, Jerome Bosch, one of the greatest Flemish painters, continues to intrigue with an oeuvre as fascinating as it is mysterious, with multiple interpretations. Through The Garden of Earthly Delights, art historians, philosophers, and psychoanalists search for meaning and pay a vibrant homage to an artist who defies time."
